    "title": "Cirque Italia",
    "description": "Cirque Italia presents \"Spectacular productions.\" CIRQUE ITALIA reflects a unique attribute under our tents, as the show features many custom designed elements that travels from city to city.  Cirque Italia has designed for two traveling water shows - Silver Unit and Gold Unit - a stage that holds 35,000 gallons of water that performers dazzle over while thrilling the audience with every move. With this unique feature under the tent, guests will be surprised, for it\u2019s a show of its own!  Cirque Italia newest show \"Paranormal Cirque\" is a show tailored towards our mature fans wanting to escape into a thrilling experience.",
